    { q: "Is the Tradovate TradingView add-on free?", a: "It depends on your Tradovate plan. Some plans include TradingView access at no extra cost (sometimes needing a monthly re-activation), while others charge a small monthly add-on fee. Check Tradovate's current pricing for your specific account." },
